    "description": "This post-marathon training program is aimed at Intermediate runners, those of you who used either my Intermediate 1 or Intermediate 2 programs to prepare for your marathon. But even if you used another program designed by yourself or another coach, you can benefit from the following advice. First, hold a mirror up to the final ... Continue reading \"Intermediate\"",
